# Purpose
Inspiration and starting points. The same examples appear on the guest welcome
screen and on the signed-in "Your work starts here" card, so this page matches
what users see in the product.

# Generated block
The text between the gv:examples markers is generated from the product's
example list and replaced on every sync. Edit the guidance around the markers by
hand; never edit inside them. When the product adds an industry, the block is
regenerated and committed here in the same change.

# Gotchas
- Public page: no private repositories, paths, hostnames or internals in the
  markers, the generated text or this file.
- Examples are starting points. Do not promise certified designs, compliance
  sign-off or finished systems.
- Keep the guidance in brand voice: small words, one idea per sentence.

# Change History
- 2026-10-24: Created at the product owner's request: one shared example list
  for guests, signed-in users and agents.
